  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Updating ASL Data**\n\nI\'m now focused on incorporating authentic American Sign Language data into `src/data/interviewData.ts`. This involves adhering to ASL\'s grammatical structure, specifically using Time-Topic-Comment, classifier predicates, spatial loci references, and authentic mouth morphemes. The goal is to accurately represent the language\'s nuances.\n\n\n**Refining ASL Glosssing**\n\nI\'m now diving deeper into ASL grammatical structures. Specifically, I\'m integrating adverbial mouth morphemes like `[mm]`, `[cha]`, `[cs]`, and `[pah!]` into `src/data/interviewData.ts`. Also focusing on spatial loci and topic markers, such as eyebrow raises and rhetorical question indicators, to enrich the representation. I need to make sure I am doing this correctly, for Deaf educators.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_335004"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import { QuestionData, CompetencyScore, CandidateProfile } from \'../types/interview\';\\n\\nexport const CANDIDATE_PROFILE: CandidateProfile = {\\n  name: \'Alex Rivera\',\\n  role: \'Senior Product Designer\',\\n  experience: \'7 years experience \302\267 Universal Design & Systems\',\\n  matchScore: 94,\\n  recommendation: \'Strong Hire\',\\n  accessibilityVerified: true,\\n  avatarSeed: \'alex-rivera-designer\',\\n  aslProficiencyRating: \'Native / Full Professional Signer (ASLPI Level 5)\',\\n};\\n\\nexport const COMPETENCY_SCORES: CompetencyScore[] = [\\n  {\\n    name: \'Technical Depth\',\\n    score: 9.6,\\n    maxScore: 10,\\n    justification: \'Demonstrated elite command of scalable design systems, multi-modal interaction architectures, and WCAG AAA compliance standards.\',\\n    trend: \'Top 3% of cohort\',\\n    linguisticEvidence: \'Accurate technical classifier predicates (CL:C, CL:Flat-B) mapped to modular design token hierarchies in 3D spatial space.\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    name: \'Problem Solving\',\\n    score: 9.3,\\n    maxScore: 10,\\n    justification: \'Utilized empirical usability recordings rather than ideological debate to solve high-pressure engineering misalignment within 48 hours.\',\\n    trend: \'Top 5% of cohort\',\\n    linguisticEvidence: \'Clear spatial contrastive grammar between engineering constraints (left locus) and design tokens (right locus) resolved into unified center.\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    name: \'Leadership\',\\n    score: 9.5,\\n    maxScore: 10,\\n    justification: \'Established asynchronous visual documentation hubs and silent collaboration workflows that improved cross-team velocity by 28%.\',\\n    trend: \'Top 4% of cohort\',\\n    linguisticEvidence: \'Natural leadership directional verbs (LEAD-TEAM, SYNC-ASYNC) with assertive affirmative head nods and forward torso engagement.\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    name: \'Clarity of Thought\',\\n    score: 9.2,\\n    maxScore: 10,\\n    justification: \'Rigorous STAR-framework responses with concise contextual framing, precise spatial sign taxonomy, and quantified operational outcomes.\',\\n    trend: \'Top 8% of cohort\',\\n    linguisticEvidence: \'Flawless Time-Topic-Comment sentence structures with appropriate non-manual markers (topic brow-raises, mouth morpheme culmination).\',\\n  },\\n];\\n\\nexport const INTERVIEW_QUESTIONS: QuestionData[] = [\\n  {\\n    id: 1,\\n    numberText: \'Question 1 of 3\',\\n    question: \'Tell us about a complex project you led and how you handled team communication.\',\\n    context: \'Focus on project scope, cross-functional collaboration, and communication strategies.\',\\n    suggestedDurationSec: 32,\\n    linguisticMetrics: {\\n      spatialLociAccuracy: 98.4,\\n      nmmGrammarScore: 97.2,\\n      classifierFluency: 96.8,\\n      signVocabularyRichness: \'Advanced Design & Engineering Lexicon\',\\n    },\\n    glossSequence: [\\n      {\\n        timeMs: 1000,\\n        token: \'TIME: PAST\',\\n        meaning: \'Timeframe baseline (Topic setting)\',\\n        confidence: 0.99,\\n        handshapeName: \'Flat-B hand\',\\n        palmOrientation: \'Backward towards shoulder\',\\n        spatialLocus: \'Upper right over-shoulder space\',\\n        nmm: {\\n          eyebrows: \'raised\',\\n          head: \'tilt-right\',\\n          mouthMorpheme: \'neutral\',\\n          description: \'Topic boundary marker: raised eyebrows establish temporal context.\',\\n        },\\n      },\\n      {\\n        timeMs: 4000,\\n        token: \'PROJECT COMPLEX (scale: huge)\',\\n        meaning: \'Multi-team design system overhaul\',\\n        confidence: 0.98,\\n        handshapeName: \'Bent-5 (Claw) bilateral\',\\n        palmOrientation: \'Inward facing, expanding outwards\',\\n        spatialLocus: \'Mid-chest signing zone\',\\n        nmm: {\\n          eyebrows: \'neutral\',\\n          head: \'forward\',\\n          mouthMorpheme: \'cha\',\\n          descripti