        instruction: "import { QuestionData, CompetencyScore, CandidateProfile } from \'../types/interview\';\n\nexport const CANDIDATE_PROFILE: CandidateProfile = {\n  name: \'Alex Rivera\',\n  role: \'Senior Product Designer\',\n  experience: \'7 years experience \302\267 Universal Design & Systems\',\n  matchScore: 94,\n  recommendation: \'Strong Hire\',\n  accessibilityVerified: true,\n  avatarSeed: \'alex-rivera-designer\',\n  aslProficiencyRating: \'Native / Full Professional Signer (ASLPI Level 5)\',\n};\n\nexport const COMPETENCY_SCORES: CompetencyScore[] = [\n  {\n    name: \'Technical Depth\',\n    score: 9.6,\n    maxScore: 10,\n    justification: \'Demonstrated elite command of scalable design systems, multi-modal interaction architectures, and WCAG AAA compliance standards.\',\n    trend: \'Top 3% of cohort\',\n    linguisticEvidence: \'Accurate technical classifier predicates (CL:C, CL:Flat-B) mapped to modular design token hierarchies in 3D spatial space.\',\n  },\n  {\n    name: \'Problem Solving\',\n    score: 9.3,\n    maxScore: 10,\n    justification: \'Utilized empirical usability recordings rather than ideological debate to solve high-pressure engineering misalignment within 48 hours.\',\n    trend: \'Top 5% of cohort\',\n    linguisticEvidence: \'Clear spatial contrastive grammar between engineering constraints (left locus) and design tokens (right locus) resolved into unified center.\',\n  },\n  {\n    name: \'Leadership\',\n    score: 9.5,\n    maxScore: 10,\n    justification: \'Established asynchronous visual documentation hubs and silent collaboration workflows that improved cross-team velocity by 28%.\',\n    trend: \'Top 4% of cohort\',\n    linguisticEvidence: \'Natural leadership directional verbs (LEAD-TEAM, SYNC-ASYNC) with assertive affirmative head nods and forward torso engagement.\',\n  },\n  {\n    name: \'Clarity of Thought\',\n    score: 9.2,\n    maxScore: 10,\n    justification: \'Rigorous STAR-framework responses with concise contextual framing, precise spatial sign taxonomy, and quantified operational outcomes.\',\n    trend: \'Top 8% of cohort\',\n    linguisticEvidence: \'Flawless Time-Topic-Comment sentence structures with appropriate non-manual markers (topic brow-raises, mouth morpheme culmination).\',\n  },\n];\n\nexport const INTERVIEW_QUESTIONS: QuestionData[] = [\n  {\n    id: 1,\n    numberText: \'Question 1 of 3\',\n    question: \'Tell us about a complex project you led and how you handled team communication.\',\n    context: \'Focus on project scope, cross-functional collaboration, and communication strategies.\',\n    suggestedDurationSec: 32,\n    linguisticMetrics: {\n      spatialLociAccuracy: 98.4,\n      nmmGrammarScore: 97.2,\n      classifierFluency: 96.8,\n      signVocabularyRichness: \'Advanced Design & Engineering Lexicon\',\n    },\n    glossSequence: [\n      {\n        timeMs: 1000,\n        token: \'TIME: PAST\',\n        meaning: \'Timeframe baseline (Topic setting)\',\n        confidence: 0.99,\n        handshapeName: \'Flat-B hand\',\n        palmOrientation: \'Backward towards shoulder\',\n        spatialLocus: \'Upper right over-shoulder space\',\n        nmm: {\n          eyebrows: \'raised\',\n          head: \'tilt-right\',\n          mouthMorpheme: \'neutral\',\n          description: \'Topic boundary marker: raised eyebrows establish temporal context.\',\n        },\n      },\n      {\n        timeMs: 4000,\n        token: \'PROJECT COMPLEX (scale: huge)\',\n        meaning: \'Multi-team design system overhaul\',\n        confidence: 0.98,\n        handshapeName: \'Bent-5 (Claw) bilateral\',\n        palmOrientation: \'Inward facing, expanding outwards\',\n        spatialLocus: \'Mid-chest signing zone\',\n        nmm: {\n          eyebrows: \'neutral\',\n          head: \'forward\',\n          mouthMorpheme: \'cha\',\n          description: \'Mouth morpheme \"cha\" denotes substantial size and complexity.\',\n        },\n      },\n      {\n        timeMs: 7500,\n        token: \'PRO-1 LEAD\',\n        meaning: \'I served as direct lead\',\n        confidence: 0.99,\n        handshapeName: \'Flat-B dominant pulling non-dominant\',\n        palmOrientation: \'Inward towards center torso\',\n        spatialLocus: \'Center forward axis\',\n        nmm: {\n          eyebrows: \'assertive\',\n          head: \'nod\',\n          mouthMorpheme: \'mm\',\n          description: \'Affirmative head nod reinforces leadership ownership.\',\n        },\n      },\n      {\n        timeMs: 11500,\n        token: \'TEAM FOUR-CL (cross-functional)\',\n        meaning: \'4 distinct cross-functional squads\',\n        confidence: 0.97,\n        handshapeName: \'4-Hand classifier sweeping arc\',\n        palmOrientation: \'Facing signer, spreading left-to-right\',\n        spatialLocus: \'Spatial arc: Loci 1, 2, 3, 4\',\n        nmm: {\n          eyebrows: \'raised\',\n          head: \'neutral\',\n          mouthMorpheme: \'puff-cheeks\',\n          description: \'Puffed cheeks accompany 4-squad classifier indexing.\',\n        },\n      },\n      {\n        timeMs: 15500,\n        token: \'SPOKEN-MEETING BARRIER\',\n        meaning: \'Spoken meetings created sync friction\',\n        confidence: 0.96,\n        handshapeName: \'S-Fist colliding with Index-1\',\n        palmOrientation: \'Opposing contralateral\',\n        spatialLocus: \'Center throat height\',\n        nmm: {\n          eyebrows: \'furrowed\',\n          head: \'neutral\',\n          mouthMorpheme: \'th\',\n          description: \'Furrowed eyebrows denote problem identification.\',\n        },\n      },\n      {\n        timeMs: 19500,\n        token: \'CREATE VISUAL-BOARD ASYNC\',\n        meaning: \'Architected async visual documentation hub\',\n        confidence: 0.98,\n        handshapeName: \'Flat-B dual hands mapping grid\',\n        palmOrientation: \'Facing outward, drafting horizontal tiers\',\n        spatialLocus: \'Visual spatial canvas in front of chest\',\n        nmm: {\n          eyebrows: \'raised\',\n          head: \'nod\',\n          mouthMorpheme: \'mm\',\n          description: \'Relaxed \"mm\" morpheme signals systematic execution.\',\n        },\n      },\n      {\n        timeMs: 24000,\n        token: \'DAILY SILENT-SYNC (Slack/Figma)\',\n        meaning: \'Instituted silent asynchronous huddles\',\n        confidence: 0.97,\n        handshapeName: \'Index-1 repetitive cyclic rhythm\',\n        palmOrientation: \'Prone (downward)\',\n        spatialLocus: \'Center-right workspace zone\',\n        nmm: {\n          eyebrows: \'neutral\',\n          head: \'nod\',\n          mouthMorpheme: \'mm\',\n          description: \'Repetitive aspect inflection denotes daily recurring habit.\',\n        },\n      },\n      {\n        timeMs: 28000,\n        token: \'FINISH TWO-WEEKS EARLY\',\n        meaning: \'Delivered release 2 weeks ahead of schedule\',\n        confidence: 0.99,\n        handshapeName: \'V-Hand (2) forward glide into FINISH-5\',\n        palmOrientation: \'Forward, twisting upward to palms-up\',\n        spatialLocus: \'Forward forward timeline\',\n        nmm: {\n          eyebrows: \'assertive\',\n          head: \'nod\',\n          mouthMorpheme: \'pah!\',\n          description: \'Mouth morpheme \"pah!\" expresses triumphant completion.\',\n        },\n      },\n      {\n        timeMs: 31000,\n        token: \'SUCCESS ZERO-REGRESSION\',\n        meaning: \'Shipped flawlessly with zero accessibility bugs\',\n        confidence: 0.99,\n        handshapeName: \'Dual Index-1 twisting outward\',\n        palmOrientation: \'Supine to outward\',\n        spatialLocus: \'Upper neutral space\',\n        nmm: {\n          eyebrows: \'raised\',\n          head: \'nod\',\n          mouthMorpheme: \'pah!\',\n          description: \'Dual sign culmination with warm confident gaze.\',\n        },\n      },\n    ],\n    sampleEnglishTranscript:\n      \'In my previous role, I directed the complete overhaul of our core enterprise design system across four cross-functional product teams. Because standard spoken meetings often created information silos and fatigue, I instituted a visual-first documentation board paired with daily asynchronous Slack standups. This visual taxonomy kept engineers and product managers tightly aligned, eliminating specification ambiguities and enabling us to ship the entire release two weeks ahead of schedule with zero accessibility regressions.\',\n    aiJudgmentNote:\n      \'Candidate articulated high-level strategic ownership using textbook STAR structure. Proactively converted potential communication barriers into an asynchronous visual system that benefited the entire cross-functional team, delivering the project 2 weeks ahead of target.\',\n    competencyHighlights: [\'Leadership\', \'Asynchronous Systems\', \'Technical Execution\'],\n    sampleGestures: [\n      {\n        startMs: 0,\n        endMs: 3500,\n        primaryHand: \'right\',\n        handshape: \'flatB\',\n        handshapeName: \'Flat-B (Past Timeframe)\',\n        motion: \'chestSweep\',\n        targetLocus: { x: 50, y: -40, z: -20 },\n      },\n      {\n        startMs: 3500,\n        endMs: 7500,\n        primaryHand: \'both\',\n        handshape: \'open5\',\n        handshapeName: \'Claw-5 (Complex Scale)\',\n        motion: \'circular\',\n        targetLocus: { x: 0, y: 10, z: 15 },\n      },\n      {\n        startMs: 7500,\n        endMs: 11500,\n        primaryHand: \'both\',\n        handshape: \'flatB\',\n        handshapeName: \'Flat-B & Index (Directional Lead)\',\n        motion: \'forwardPush\',\n        targetLocus: { x: 0, y: 20, z: 30 },\n      },\n      {\n        startMs: 11500,\n        endMs: 15500,\n        primaryHand: \'right\',\n        handshape: \'pointing\',\n        handshapeName: \'4-Finger Classifier (Arc Indexing)\',\n        motion: \'horizontalWave\',\n        targetLocus: { x: -30, y: 0, z: 20 },\n      },\n      {\n        startMs: 15500,\n        endMs: 19500,\n        primaryHand: \'both\',\n        handshape: \'fist\',\n        handshapeName: \'S-Fist (Barrier Collision)\',\n        motion: \'forwardPush\',\n        targetLocus: { x: 0, y: 5, z: 10 },\n      },\n      {\n        startMs: 19500,\n        endMs: 24000,\n        primaryHand: \'both\',\n        handshape: \'flatB\',\n        handshapeName: \'Flat-B Dual (Grid Mapping)\',\n        motion: \'horizontalWave\',\n        targetLocus: { x: 0, y: 15, z: 25 },\n      },\n      {\n        startMs: 24000,\n        endMs: 28000,\n        primaryHand: \'right\',\n        handshape: \'pointing\',\n        handshapeName: \'Index-1 Cyclic (Daily Sync)\',\n        motion: \'circular\',\n        targetLocus: { x: 20, y: 10, z: 15 },\n      },\n      {\n        startMs: 28000,\n        endMs: 32000,\n        primaryHand: \'both\',\n        handshape: \'open5\',\n        handshapeName: \'FINISH-5 to SUCCESS-1 (Pah!)\',\n        motion: \'chestSweep\',\n        targetLocus: { x: 0, y: -20, z: 10 },\n      },\n    ],\n  },\n  {\n    id: 2,\n    numberText: \'Question 2 of 3\',\n    question: \'Describe a time you had to resolve a conflict or misalignment under a tight deadline.\',\n    context: \'Focus on stakeholder management, empathy under pressure, and conflict resolution.\',\n    suggestedDurationSec: 30,\n    linguisticMetrics: {\n      spatialLociAccuracy: 99.1,\n      nmmGrammarScore: 98.0,\n      classifierFluency: 97.5,\n      signVocabularyRichness: \'Negotiation & Technical Standards Lexicon\',\n    },\n    glossSequence: [\n      {\n        timeMs: 1000,\n        token: \'TIME: LAST-YEAR Q3\',\n        meaning: \'Specific product release cycle\',\n        confidence: 0.98,\n        handshapeName: \'1-Hand pointing backward\',\n        palmOrientation: \'Backward to chest\',\n        spatialLocus: \'Right shoulder temporal axis\',\n        nmm: {\n          eyebrows: \'raised\',\n          head: \'tilt-right\',\n          mouthMorpheme: \'neutral\',\n          description: \'Topic eyebrow raise anchors Q3 timeframe.\',\n        },\n      },\n      {\n        timeMs: 4000,\n        token: \'DEADLINE TIGHT 48-HOURS\',\n        meaning: \'Extreme 48-hour code freeze constraint\',\n        confidence: 0.99,\n        handshapeName: \'Index & Thumb pinched (G-hand) near cheek\',\n        palmOrientation: \'Inward facing cheek\',\n        spatialLocus: \'Near right cheek\',\n        nmm: {\n          eyebrows: \'furrowed\',\n          head: \'forward\',\n          mouthMorpheme: \'cs\',\n          description: \'Mouth morpheme \"cs\" indicates extreme urgency / closeness.\',\n        },\n      },\n      {\n        timeMs: 8000,\n        token: \'LOCUS-A [ENGINEER] vs LOCUS-B [DESIGN] DISAGREE\',\n        meaning: \'Sharp contrast ratio standoff between teams\',\n        confidence: 0.97,\n        handshapeName: \'Bent-V dual hands crossing\',\n        palmOrientation: \'Facing each other in confrontation\',\n        spatialLocus: \'Left Locus (Eng) vs Right Locus (Design)\',\n        nmm: {\n          eyebrows: \'furrowed\',\n          head: \'tilt-left\',\n          mouthMorpheme: \'neutral\',\n          description: \'Spatial contrast established between left and right loci.\',\n        },\n      },\n      {\n        timeMs: 12500,\n        token: \'ACCESSIBILITY WCAG AAA (Non-negotiable)\',\n        meaning: \'Full legal and ethical AAA compliance\',\n        confidence: 0.98,\n        handshapeName: \'Flat-B base palm with dominant tapping rule\',\n        palmOrientation: \'Prone on supine palm\',\n        spatialLocus: \'Center lower signing volume\',\n        nmm: {\n          eyebrows: \'assertive\',\n          head: \'nod\',\n          mouthMorpheme: \'firm\',\n          description: \'Head nod affirms non-negotiable compliance stance.\',\n        },\n      },\n      {\n        timeMs: 17000,\n        token: \'ME CALL-MEETING RAPID-LAB\',\n        meaning: \'Convened hands-on collaborative prototype lab\',\n        confidence: 0.96,\n        handshapeName: \'Open-5 hands gathering inwards to center\',\n        palmOrientation: \'Inward facing, uniting loci\',\n        spatialLocus: \'Center common workspace\',\n        nmm: {\n          eyebrows: \'raised\',\n          head: \'nod\',\n          mouthMorpheme: \'mm\',\n          description: \'Constructive mediator posture with open palms.\',\n        },\n      },\n      {\n        timeMs: 21500,\n        token: \'SHOW SCREEN-RECORD USER-DATA\',\n        meaning: \'Demonstrated live usability friction recordings\',\n        confidence: 0.99,\n        handshapeName: \'C-Hand projector with Flat-B screen\',\n        palmOrientation: \'Outward projecting onto virtual screen\',\n        spatialLocus: \'Neutral display plane in front of eyes\',\n        nmm: {\n          eyebrows: \'raised\',\n          head: \'neutral\',\n          mouthMorpheme: \'look\',\n          description: \'Gaze direction aligns with virtual projected evidence.\',\n        },\n      },\n      {\n        timeMs: 25500,\n        token: \'NEW-PALETTE CO-CREATE AGREE\',\n        meaning: \'Engineers & designers co-crafted dual-token palette\',\n        confidence: 0.98,\n        handshapeName: \'F-Hands interlinking (CONNECT/AGREE)\',\n        palmOrientation: \'Facing each other, clasping thumbs/indexes\',\n        spatialLocus: \'Center convergence locus\',\n        nmm: {\n          eyebrows: \'neutral\',\n          head: \'nod\',\n          mouthMorpheme: \'mm\',\n          description: \'Consensus nod with interlinked F-hand agreement.\',\n        },\n      },\n      {\n        timeMs: 29000,\n        token: \'SHIP ON-TIME CLEAN\',\n        meaning: \'Shipped compliant on time with zero delay\',\n        confidence: 0.99,\n        handshapeName: \'Flat-B hands sailing forward smoothly\',\n        palmOrientation: \'Prone gliding forward\',\n        spatialLocus: \'Forward trajectory\',\n        nmm: {\n          eyebrows: \'assertive\',\n          head: \'nod\',\n          mouthMorpheme: \'pah!\',\n          description: \'Culmination morpheme \"pah!\" with smooth forward release.\',\n        },\n      },\n    ],\n    sampleEnglishTranscript:\n      \'During our major Q3 release, our design and front-end engineering teams reached a sharp standoff over accessibility contrast tokens just 48 hours prior to code freeze. Rather than escalating up executive lines, I convened an immediate hands-on co-design workshop where I shared screen recordings of users with low vision failing the checkout flow with our initial colors. Grounding the dispute in user data depersonalized the conflict; we co-crafted a dual-layer token set that preserved the marketing aesthetics while securing full WCAG AAA compliance, deploying on time without friction.\',\n    aiJudgmentNote:\n      \'Demonstrated high emotional intelligence and consensus building. Defused an impending launch delay by replacing subjective debate with empirical user evidence, protecting both brand fidelity and non-negotiable accessibility.\',\n    competencyHighlights: [\'Conflict Resolution\', \'Data-Driven Advocacy\', \'Deadline Discipline\'],\n    sampleGestures: [\n      {\n        startMs: 0,\n        endMs: 4000,\n        primaryHand: \'right\',\n        handshape: \'pointing\',\n        handshapeName: \'1-Hand Back (Q3 Locus)\',\n        motion: \'chestSweep\',\n        targetLocus: { x: 30, y: -30, z: -10 },\n      },\n      {\n        startMs: 4000,\n        endMs: 8000,\n        primaryHand: \'right\',\n        handshape: \'pointing\',\n        handshapeName: \'Pinch-G (Tight Deadline CS)\',\n        motion: \'forwardPush\',\n        targetLocus: { x: 25, y: -15, z: 5 },\n      },\n      {\n        startMs: 8000,\n        endMs: 12500,\n        primaryHand: \'both\',\n        handshape: \'bentV\',\n        handshapeName: \'Bent-V Clash (Engineering vs Design)\',\n        motion: \'alternating\',\n        targetLocus: { x: -20, y: 10, z: 20 },\n      },\n      {\n        startMs: 12500,\n        endMs: 17000,\n        primaryHand: \'both\',\n        handshape: \'flatB\',\n        handshapeName: \'Flat-B Rule Stamp (AAA WCAG)\',\n        motion: \'forwardPush\',\n        targetLocus: { x: 0, y: 25, z: 15 },\n      },\n      {\n        startMs: 17000,\n        endMs: 21500,\n        primaryHand: \'both\',\n        handshape: \'open5\',\n        handshapeName: \'Open-5 Converge (Emergency Co-Lab)\',\n        motion: \'circular\',\n        targetLocus: { x: 0, y: 10, z: 20 },\n      },\n      {\n        startMs: 21500,\n        endMs: 25500,\n        primaryHand: \'both\',\n        handshape: \'cShape\',\n        handshapeName: \'Projector & Screen (Usability Data)\',\n        motion: \'forwardPush\',\n        targetLocus: { x: 0, y: -5, z: 30 },\n      },\n      {\n        startMs: 25500,\n        endMs: 30000,\n        primaryHand: \'both\',\n        handshape: \'open5\',\n        handshapeName: \'Interlink-F to Glide (Ship Clean Pah!)\',\n        motion: \'chestSweep\',\n        targetLocus: { x: 0, y: 0, z: 35 },\n      },\n    ],\n  },\n  {\n    id: 3,\n    numberText: \'Question 3 of 3\',\n    question: \'Why are you excited about this role, and what unique perspective do you bring?\',\n    context: \'Focus on mission alignment, lived experience, and technical contribution.\',\n    suggestedDurationSec: 28,\n    linguisticMetrics: {\n      spatialLociAccuracy: 99.4,\n      nmmGrammarScore: 98.7,\n      classifierFluency: 98.1,\n      signVocabularyRichness: \'Philosophy & Multimodal Systems Lexicon\',\n    },\n    glossSequence: [\n      {\n        timeMs: 1000,\n        token: \'FEEL-EXCITED DEEP-HEART\',\n        meaning: \'Deep authentic intrinsic motivation\',\n        confidence: 0.99,\n        handshapeName: \'Middle-finger open hand grazing chest upward\',\n        palmOrientation: \'Inward against sternum\',\n        spatialLocus: \'Heart center\',\n        nmm: {\n          eyebrows: \'raised\',\n          head: \'forward\',\n          mouthMorpheme: \'warm\',\n          description: \'Warm open expression conveys genuine connection.\',\n        },\n      },\n      {\n        timeMs: 4500,\n        token: \'COMPANY MISSION: ACCESS EVERYONE\',\n        meaning: \'Alignment with universal accessibility mission\',\n        confidence: 0.98,\n        handshapeName: \'Open-5 bilateral expanding outward to encompass world\',\n        palmOrientation: \'Outward and upward\',\n        spatialLocus: \'Wide peripheral envelope\',\n        nmm: {\n          eyebrows: \'raised\',\n          head: \'nod\',\n          mouthMorpheme: \'cha\',\n          description: \'Broad sweeping sign scope with affirming posture.\',\n        },\n      },\n      {\n        timeMs: 8800,\n        token: \'MY PERSPECTIVE: DEAF LIVED-EXPERIENCE\',\n        meaning: \'Daily lived experience as a Deaf designer\',\n        confidence: 0.99,\n        handshapeName: \'Index touching ear then mouth (DEAF) into PRO-1\',\n        palmOrientation: \'Inward cheek and chest\',\n        spatialLocus: \'Cheek to heart locus\',\n        nmm: {\n          eyebrows: \'neutral\',\n          head: \'nod\',\n          mouthMorpheme: \'mm\',\n          description: \'Grounded authenticity with direct contact sign.\',\n        },\n      },\n      {\n        timeMs: 13200,\n        token: \'NOT CHECKLIST COMPLIANCE (Core DNA)\',\n        meaning: \'Accessibility is foundational architecture, not an afterthought\',\n        confidence: 0.97,\n        handshapeName: \'Flat-B waving negation (NO-NO) into S-Fist foundation\',\n        palmOrientation: \'Outward waving then prone downward\',\n        spatialLocus: \'Lower bedrock workspace\',\n        nmm: {\n          eyebrows: \'assertive\',\n          head: \'shake\',\n          mouthMorpheme: \'firm\',\n          description: \'Headshake cleanly separates compliance from genuine DNA.\',\n        },\n      },\n      {\n        timeMs: 17800,\n        token: \'EXPERTISE: GESTURE MULTIMODAL SPATIAL-UI\',\n        meaning: \'7 years mastery of gesture and spatial interfaces\',\n        confidence: 0.98,\n        handshapeName: \'Curved-5 hands shaping 3D digital objects in space\',\n        palmOrientation: \'Manipulating virtual 3D bounding geometry\',\n        spatialLocus: \'Full 3D volumetric envelope\',\n        nmm: {\n          eyebrows: \'raised\',\n          head: \'nod\',\n          mouthMorpheme: \'cha\',\n          description: \'Eyes follow hand trajectory as virtual interfaces form.\',\n        },\n      },\n      {\n        timeMs: 22500,\n        token: \'COLLABORATE ELEVATE PRODUCT\',\n        meaning: \'Ready to drive breakthrough user experiences with your team\',\n        confidence: 0.99,\n        handshapeName: \'Interlocking 5-Hands stepping upward in tiers\',\n        palmOrientation: \'Facing each other, escalating upward\',\n        spatialLocus: \'Ascending forward axis\',\n        nmm: {\n          eyebrows: \'assertive\',\n          head: \'nod\',\n          mouthMorpheme: \'pah!\',\n          description: \'Rising gesture paired with celebratory assertion.\',\n        },\n      },\n      {\n        timeMs: 27000,\n        token: \'READY CONTRIBUTE TOGETHER\',\n        meaning: \'Eager and prepared to build the future of inclusive software\',\n        confidence: 0.99,\n        handshapeName: \'Dual Flat-B open palms welcoming collaboration\',\n        palmOrientation: \'Supine (palms up) offered forward\',\n        spatialLocus: \'Forward partner plane\',\n        nmm: {\n          eyebrows: \'neutral\',\n          head: \'nod\',\n          mouthMorpheme: \'smile\',\n          description: \'Inviting forward gesture closes the interview warmly.\',\n        },\n      },\n    ],\n    sampleEnglishTranscript:\n      \'I have dedicated my career to universal interface architecture because accessibility is not an edge-case checklist for me\342\200\224it is how I navigate every digital touchpoint in my daily life as a Deaf designer. I bring seven years of expertise in gesture-driven UX, spatial design, and sensory-balanced design systems. I am excited about this role because your product vision treats inclusive design not as a compliance afterthought, but as the primary engine of breakthrough user experiences.\',\n    aiJudgmentNote:\n      \'Exceptional alignment with role philosophy. Articulates how lived experience uniquely strengthens product architecture and multi-modal interaction design. Conveys unwavering passion with concrete value delivery.\',\n    competencyHighlights: [\'Universal Design Vision\', \'Multimodal Systems\', \'Lived Experience\'],\n    sampleGestures: [\n      {\n        startMs: 0,\n        endMs: 4500,\n        primaryHand: \'right\',\n        handshape: \'flatB\',\n        handshapeName: \'Open-Middle Hand (Heart Motivation)\',\n        motion: \'chestSweep\',\n        targetLocus: { x: 0, y: -10, z: 0 },\n      },\n      {\n        startMs: 4500,\n        endMs: 8800,\n        primaryHand: \'both\',\n        handshape: \'open5\',\n        handshapeName: \'Open-5 Universal (World Scope)\',\n        motion: \'circular\',\n        targetLocus: { x: 0, y: 10, z: 20 },\n      },\n      {\n        startMs: 8800,\n        endMs: 13200,\n        primaryHand: \'right\',\n        handshape: \'pointing\',\n        handshapeName: \'DEAF Index-Touch (Lived Identity)\',\n        motion: \'forwardPush\',\n        targetLocus: { x: 20, y: -25, z: 5 },\n      },\n      {\n        startMs: 13200,\n        endMs: 17800,\n        primaryHand: \'both\',\n        handshape: \'flatB\',\n        handshapeName: \'Flat-B Negation to Bedrock Foundation\',\n        motion: \'horizontalWave\',\n        targetLocus: { x: 0, y: 25, z: 15 },\n      },\n      {\n        startMs: 17800,\n        endMs: 22500,\n        primaryHand: \'both\',\n        handshape: \'cShape\',\n        handshapeName: \'Curved-5 3D Spatial Sculpting\',\n        motion: \'circular\',\n        targetLocus: { x: 0, y: 0, z: 30 },\n      },\n      {\n        startMs: 22500,\n        endMs: 28000,\n        primaryHand: \'both\',\n        handshape: \'open5\',\n        handshapeName: \'Ascending Steps to Open Offer (Together)\',\n        motion: \'chestSweep\',\n        targetLocus: { x: 0, y: 15, z: 25 },\n      },\n    ],\n  },\n];\n"
