            lines {
              text: "      \'During our major Q3 release, our design and front-end engineering teams reached a sharp standoff over accessibility contrast tokens just 48 hours prior to code freeze. Rather than escalating up executive lines, I convened an immediate hands-on co-design workshop where I shared screen recordings of users with low vision failing the checkout flow with our initial colors. Grounding the dispute in user data depersonalized the conflict; we co-crafted a dual-layer token set that preserved the marketing aesthetics while securing full WCAG AAA compliance, deploying on time without friction.\',"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
