  planner_response {
    response: "I have upgraded the prototype to reflect authentic **American Sign Language (ASL) linguistics, computer vision telemetry, and anatomical articulation**:\n\n### Key Authenticity & Realism Enhancements\n\n1. **The 5 Linguistic Parameters of ASL Phonology**\n   - **Authentic Handshapes:** The signer model articulates true ASL handshapes (e.g., *Flat-B* for timeframes, *Bent-5/Claw* for complex scale, *Bent-V* for engineering/design friction, *Pinch-G* for close deadlines, and *Interlinked-F* for consensus).\n   - **3D Spatial Loci Indexing:** Visualizes ASL spatial grammar directly on the canvas HUD with **Locus A (Left: Engineering)**, **Locus B (Right: Design/Product)**, and **Center (Synthesis/Common Workspace)**, with spatial indexing arcs connecting them when directional verbs are signed.\n   - **Non-Manual Markers (NMM):**\n     - **Eyebrows:** Dynamic eyebrow raises for Time/Topic boundaries (`__t__`) and furrowing for problem statements.\n     - **Authentic ASL Mouth Morphemes:** Animated mouth articulators producing real ASL morphemes\342\200\224`\"cha\"` (enormous scale), `\"cs\"` (tight/close deadline), `\"pah!\"` (triumphant completion), and `\"mm\"` (routine workflow).\n     - **Head Kinematics:** Assertive nods for leadership ownership and rhythmic headshakes for boundary contrast.\n\n2. **MediaPipe Holistic 543-Landmark Suite**\n   - **BlazePose 33-Point Upper-Body Rig:** Renders shoulders, elbows, and wrists connecting to the hands with kinematic bone segments.\n   - **Dual 21-Joint Hand Tracking:** Left and Right hands tracked with joint radius sizing, confidence scores, and real-time velocity vectors ($44\\,\\text{cm/s}$).\n   - **FaceMesh Contours:** Facial landmark mesh mapping eye contours, nose bridge, jawline, and NMM markers.\n   - **Rig Mode Toggles:** Quickly switch between **\"Full Rig\"**, **\"Hands Only\"**, and **\"Kinematic Vectors\"**, or toggle the **\"Loci Grid\"** on and off.\n\n3. **Multi-Tier Linguistic Pipeline**\n   - Replaced flat token tickers with an authentic multi-tier linguistic breakdown:\n     - **Tier 1:** Non-Manual Markers (NMM) with active mouth morpheme indicators\n     - **Tier 2:** Time-Topic-Comment ASL Gloss Sequence with handshape names\n     - **Tier 3:** Spatial Locus Coordinates\n     - **Tier 4:** Synthesized English Transcript\n   - Real-time linguistic telemetry strip displaying **Spatial Loci Accuracy (98.4%)**, **NMM Grammar Score (97.2%)**, and **Classifier Fluency (96.8%)**.\n\n4. **Recruiter Evaluation & ASLPI Level 5 Audit**\n   - Added an **\"ASL Linguistic & Phonology Audit\"** tab alongside the behavioral competency scorecard, detailing spatial verb agreement, classifier predicates, and non-manual syntax.\n   - Candidate certified with **ASLPI Level 5 (Native / Full Professional Signer)**.\n   - Replay modal updated to run the holistic 543-landmark tracking simulation for post-interview review."
    thinking: "**Analyzing ASL Parameters**\n\nI\'m thrilled! Both `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` passed perfectly. I\'m now delving into the additions for the ASL demo, aiming for deep realism and linguistic accuracy. Currently focusing on the five parameters of ASL phonology, starting with handshapes like Flat-B and Open-A.\n\n\n**Exploring ASL Parameters**\n\nI\'ve got a detailed list of handshapes now, including Claw-5, Pinch-G, and Interlinking F-hands. Palm orientations are fleshed out, with specifics like \"backward over shoulder\" for past tense. I\'m visualizing 3D spatial loci (Locus A, B, and center) and specific movements like directional verbs and cyclic aspects. I\'m also adding mouth morphemes, eyebrow raises, brow furrows, and head movements for NMMs.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have upgraded the prototype to reflect authentic **American Sign Language (ASL) linguistics, computer vision telemetry, and anatomical articulation**:\n\n### Key Authenticity & Realism Enhancements\n\n1. **The 5 Linguistic Parameters of ASL Phonology**\n   - **Authentic Handshapes:** The signer model articulates true ASL handshapes (e.g., *Flat-B* for timeframes, *Bent-5/Claw* for complex scale, *Bent-V* for engineering/design friction, *Pinch-G* for close deadlines, and *Interlinked-F* for consensus).\n   - **3D Spatial Loci Indexing:** Visualizes ASL spatial grammar directly on the canvas HUD with **Locus A (Left: Engineering)**, **Locus B (Right: Design/Product)**, and **Center (Synthesis/Common Workspace)**, with spatial indexing arcs connecting them when directional verbs are signed.\n   - **Non-Manual Markers (NMM):**\n     - **Eyebrows:** Dynamic eyebrow raises for Time/Topic boundaries (`__t__`) and furrowing for problem statements.\n     - **Authentic ASL Mouth Morphemes:** Animated mouth articulators producing real ASL morphemes\342\200\224`\"cha\"` (enormous scale), `\"cs\"` (tight/close deadline), `\"pah!\"` (triumphant completion), and `\"mm\"` (routine workflow).\n     - **Head Kinematics:** Assertive nods for leadership ownership and rhythmic headshakes for boundary contrast.\n\n2. **MediaPipe Holistic 543-Landmark Suite**\n   - **BlazePose 33-Point Upper-Body Rig:** Renders shoulders, elbows, and wrists connecting to the hands with kinematic bone segments.\n   - **Dual 21-Joint Hand Tracking:** Left and Right hands tracked with joint radius sizing, confidence scores, and real-time velocity vectors ($44\\,\\text{cm/s}$).\n   - **FaceMesh Contours:** Facial landmark mesh mapping eye contours, nose bridge, jawline, and NMM markers.\n   - **Rig Mode Toggles:** Quickly switch between **\"Full Rig\"**, **\"Hands Only\"**, and **\"Kinematic Vectors\"**, or toggle the **\"Loci Grid\"** on and off.\n\n3. **Multi-Tier Linguistic Pipeline**\n   - Replaced flat token tickers with an authentic multi-tier linguistic breakdown:\n     - **Tier 1:** Non-Manual Markers (NMM) with active mouth morpheme indicators\n     - **Tier 2:** Time-Topic-Comment ASL Gloss Sequence with handshape names\n     - **Tier 3:** Spatial Locus Coordinates\n     - **Tier 4:** Synthesized English Transcript\n   - Real-time linguistic telemetry strip displaying **Spatial Loci Accuracy (98.4%)**, **NMM Grammar Score (97.2%)**, and **Classifier Fluency (96.8%)**.\n\n4. **Recruiter Evaluation & ASLPI Level 5 Audit**\n   - Added an **\"ASL Linguistic & Phonology Audit\"** tab alongside the behavioral competency scorecard, detailing spatial verb agreement, classifier predicates, and non-manual syntax.\n   - Candidate certified with **ASLPI Level 5 (Native / Full Professional Signer)**.\n   - Replay modal updated to run the holistic 543-landmark tracking simulation for post-interview review."
